(7713402, 1267684, 24454, '<td valign="top">Macro perFECTION!  Foreground, background, contest!  It all makes such a lovely art piece!  And I love bees and what they symbolize.  With such a global interest in the supernatural qualities in bees these days... I imagine a social media broadcast of this photo would get you more print sales than you''d believe!  It shockingly happened to me once from a little ol'' bee photo that I thought was "just ordinary".... just sayin''  Good luck!</td>', 'Macro perFECTION!  Foreground, background, contest!  It all makes such a lovely art piece!  And I love bees and what they symbolize.  With such a global interest in the supernatural qualities in bees these days... I imagine a social media broadcast of this photo would get you more print sales than you''d believe!  It shockingly happened to me once from a little ol'' bee photo that I thought was "just ordinary".... just sayin''  Good luck!', '2022-02-01 15:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7713403, 1267775, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is so beautiful!  It''s almost unbelievable, except I watched a clip from a photographer who took you along on his quest to get a huge moon photo like this rising over a skyline so I know it''s absolutely possible... for the talented and skilled photographer that is.  Well done!  Congratulations!</td>', 'This is so beautiful!  It''s almost unbelievable, except I watched a clip from a photographer who took you along on his quest to get a huge moon photo like this rising over a skyline so I know it''s absolutely possible... for the talented and skilled photographer that is.  Well done!  Congratulations!', '2022-02-01 15:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
