(7713462, 1267767, 67145, '<td valign="top">i saw this in voting and thought of you .. 

<br/>its a brilliant image in every way .. especially those incredible colours . 

<br/>we get cicadas here in summer .. often heaps .. and sometimes not so many . 

<br/>but i''ve never seen one with red eyes ...

<br/>
<br/>a few minutes later . while i googled names of australian cicadas . and in the list there was one with red eyes  .. 

<br/>we have ones we called green grocers .. yellow mondays .. and more i cant remember .. which is why i googled to find out . 

<br/>here''s a link with the ones we have in australia .. <a href="https://www.cicadamania.com/cicadas/australian-cicada-names/" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">cicadas in australia</a>
<br/>apparently cicadas have the loudest call of any insect .. 

<br/>when we have summers when heaps of them have come out of the ground .. and walking past an area when they are all singing can be almost deafening .. :)</td>', 'i saw this in voting and thought of you .. 

its a brilliant image in every way .. especially those incredible colours . 

we get cicadas here in summer .. often heaps .. and sometimes not so many . 

